Here's how you can fix it:

```cpp
double calculate(Operation op, double num1, double num2) {
    using enum Operation;
    switch (op) {
        case add:
            return num1 + num2;
        case subtract:
            return num1 - num2;
        case multiply:
            return num1 * num2;
        case divide:
            return num1 / num2;
    }
}
```

